.env
.env.local
*.local.csv
evidence/customer-evidence-export*.md

# The BLANK official P&L template must never be committed — its own header
# says "Download this form - do not make a copy in the cloud or else it
# could be shared with others". Only the FILLED output
# (financials/pnl-sloane-pearl.xlsx) belongs in git.
#
# Patterns are broad on purpose: the real downloaded filename is
# "Build with Gemini XPRIZE - PL Template.xlsx", which the original
# `financials/pl-template-blank.xlsx` rule never matched, plus the
# " (1).xlsx" / " copy.xlsx" variants a second download produces.
*PL Template*.xlsx
*PL_Template*.xlsx
*pl-template*.xlsx

# Scratch space for local probe scripts. The committed, reusable queries
# live in financials/scripts/.
.tmp-probe/
